Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:11:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] test(motion): move the slow neck and island trochoid tests to
 the heavy lane

Each test of slice C ran alone in debug. The neck test (168 s) and the
island pocket test (154 s) are over the 60 s limit. They move to the
heavy lane with all their cases, and each gets a _light twin with one
case in the same file. The ring (50 s) and corner clean-up (29 s) tests
stay in the default suite.

Refs #3514

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
